  "paragraphs": [
    "Our advanced technology scans your child’s online activities and sends you timely alerts. You can also track location, block websites, and more. Get the best parental control app today.",
    "Our award-winning parental control app scans for dangers like predators, suicidal ideation, violence, and more. You’ll get notified if there’s something wrong.",
    "Ask about screen time, block apps, or get insights — the Bark Assistant helps you manage everything in one place.",
    "Track your kid’s location in real-time, get alerts, and find out if they’re walking, biking, or driving — including how fast!",
    "Help protect your child from inappropriate and distracting content — choose to block whole categories or specific websites and apps.",
    "Automatically block apps like YouTube and Fortnite during the school day or after bedtime so your kid can focus.",
    "Whether your kid’s device is an iPhone, Android, or a Kindle Fire, you can install the Bark parental control app on it to help protect your kid.",
    "Starts at",
    "We offer two plans — Bark Premium and Bark Jr — a single subscription covers every child and device in your family, with no limit on accounts, devices, or kids.",
    "Bark Premium ($14/month or $99/year)",
    "Bark Jr ($5/month or $49/year)",
    "The Bark app is compatible with iPhones, iPads, Android phones, Android tablets, laptops, computers, Chromebooks, and Amazon Fire tablets. Check out our full list of everything Bark can monitor on each device."
  ],
